\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0   It is Jesus Christ who reigneth;
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 as a King, all things ordaineth;
\par He who maketh all things new.
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0\fs24 
\par Ev'ry tongue the Lord addressing,
\par at the throne of Christ confessing
\par to whom thanks and praise is due,
\par to whom thanks and praise is due,
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  God is Lord, now and forever!
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 There is none His equal ever,
\par Jesus Christ, His son alone.
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0\fs24 
\par God's throne never can be shaken
\par nor the power of life be taken,
\par nor His kingdom overthrown,
\par nor His kingdom overthrown.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.   In God's son a gift from heaven,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  by His grace alone is given
\par  full redemption from all sin.
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16\'b6  Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0\fs24 
\par He who gained for all salvation,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 to became a new creation,
\par thus eternal life to win,
\par thus eternal life to win.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.   Sinners, bring your hearts as off'ring;
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 all those sick in pain or suff'ring;
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0\qj tell Him all your needs ye poor.
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\fs16\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0\fs24 
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0\qj Jesus heals the broken hearted,
\par balsam gives for wounds that smarted,
\par will eternal life ensure,
\par will eternal life ensure
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.   Waste no time, all else forsaking
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0 Mercy yours is for the taking,
\par with eternal life assured,
\par would you this good life inherit?
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0\fs24 
\par Strive this worthy life to merit,
\par thus is life in Christ secured,
\par \pard     thus is life in Christ secured.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

